tate":"uploaded","size":33550336,"digest":"sha256:483b3fbd0b0ee434c4be85fc24a2884c7308f7acc4e718566792cd9d1c239d11","download_count":43,"created_at":"2026-09-21T20:07:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T20:07:52Z"},{"id":579808205,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4ijyvN","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":38192628,"digest":"sha256:77ef8f036fa99aa7b9a349acbdf5638458ea0c44762bb984cba282b55def5618","download_count":42,"created_at":"2026-09-21T20:28:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T20:28:05Z"},{"id":579828939,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4ij3zL","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":18576,"digest":"sha256:8f7dde99515f4531afae6b5f70201fe4a90416d1a0ec004edc4d05ebe8a5c543","download_count":7415,"created_at":"2026-09-21T20:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T20:42:05Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- 新增 Apache Solr 连接支持，可浏览 Core、查看 Schema 字段、执行文档查询与增删改，并提供 REST 控制台 (contributed by @yaoxinghuo) (PR [#9850](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9850))\n- MySQL 用户权限编辑支持数据库级与表级的可视化授权 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#9744](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9744))\n- MongoDB 旧版 Agent 连接支持集合统计与新建数据库 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#9893](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9893))\n- MongoDB 旧版 Agent 连接支持 findOneAndUpdate、findOneAndReplace 与 findOneAndDelete (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#9838](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9838))\n- MongoDB 旧版 Agent 连接支持 distinct 查询 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#9884](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9884))\n- MongoDB 库表视图显示集合占用空间并支持按大小排序 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9810](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9810))\n- PostgreSQL 与 Kingbase 支持查看分区表详细信息并管理分区 (contributed by @amwps290) (PR [#9812](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9812))\n- Excel 批量建表导入支持勾选要导入的工作表 (contributed by @tdog54646) (PR [#9910](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9910))\n- MCP 固定会话支持通过环境变量 DBX_SESSION_IDLE_TTL_SECS 配置空闲超时 (contributed by @tdog54646) (PR [#9909](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9909))\n- 查询历史保留条数支持在设置中配置 (contributed by @tdog54646) (PR [#9908](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9908))\n- 表属性抽屉新增「表信息」页签，集中查看表基本信息与体积统计 (contributed by @sxhjlzl) (PR [#9876](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9876))\n- SQL 编辑器新增「跳转到行」，可输入行号快速定位（Ctrl+G / ⌘⌥G） (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9799](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9799))\n- Oracle 执行报错时按错误消息中的行列位置定位错误并锚定光标 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9804](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9804))\n- AI 支持以只读方式附加用户级 Codex 兼容的 SKILL.md 文件作为补充指令 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#9906](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9906))\n- DDL 结构视图新增「查看数据」入口 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9790](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9790))\n- 插件工作台 UI 资源改经 dbx-plugin:// 协议加载，使用相对路径分包的插件恢复懒加载与字体加载\n- 插件 Host API 新增 storage 桥接，插件可持久化读写独立的数据目录\n\n### 改进\n\n- 表结构编辑器的列网格改为虚拟渲染，大表滚动更流畅\n- 名称相同的标签页自动添加数字后缀，便于区分 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9913](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9913))\n- 更新中心无可用更新时隐藏客户端页签 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9912](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9912))\n- 导出 SQL 时每条数据行单独成行，便于阅读与比对 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9836](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9836))\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复 MySQL group_concat_max_len 会话设置被下调覆盖服务端更高配置 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9795](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9795))\n- 修复 SQL Server 结构对比遇到 tinyint 外键时报错退出 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9842](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9842))\n- 修复 SQL Server 临时表补全返回数据库内部临时名 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9871](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9871))\n- 修复 SQL Server 存储过程体内 DECLARE 缺少数据类型时未提示语法错误 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9792](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9792))\n- 修复 Oracle 关闭「标识符添加引号」时大小写敏感标识符被去掉引号 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9793](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9793))\n- 修复达梦表数据复制粘贴到含标识列的表时失败 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#9899](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9899))\n- 修复 Meilisearch 索引侧栏显示实例总大小而非索引自身大小 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9891](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9891))\n- 修复 Meilisearch 索引创建报错信息过长时溢出界面，改为在对话框内换行展示 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#9858](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9858))\n- 修复 Cassandra 集合类型值展示不是合法 CQL 字面量 (contributed by @thanhthai3010) (PR [#9846](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9846))\n- 修复通用 JDBC 连接表格翻页未下发 rowOffset 导致分页无效 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9791](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9791))\n- 修复 OceanBase 表数量超过一千后表名悬停预览失效 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#9802](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9802))\n- 修复 MCP 批量查询结果未遵守 cell_char_offset / cell_char_limit 设置 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9922](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9922))\n- 修复 AI 数据库选择按钮在库列表加载完成前显示「选择数据库」占位文案 (contributed by @CHNHJF) (PR [#9825](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9825))\n- 修复插件 Plan API SQL 检查的关键字边界误判 (contributed by @0verme) (PR [#9859](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9859))\n- 修复复用 result-view 的插件工作台上下文未刷新 (contributed by @0verme) (PR [#9805](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9805))\n- 修复插件 result-view 上下文使用整个编辑器 SQL 而非实际执行的语句 (contributed by @0verme) (PR [#9806](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9806))\n- 修复关闭插件页签时借用的宿主连接被错误释放 (contributed by @0verme) (PR [#9816](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9816))\n- 修复 Windows 上插件重命名偶因文件锁占用失败，现自动重试\n- 修复「查看源码」后保存存储过程写错目标对象 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9853](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9853))\n- 修复 SQL 诊断刷新后输入插入点错位导致 Redis 参数输入异常 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9796](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9796))\n- 修复编辑态下压缩 JSON 后无法再次格式化 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9841](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9841))\n- 修复数据网格生成保存与复制 SQL 时未遵循「生成 SQL 时包含数据库名」设置 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9817](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9817))\n- 修复单元格编辑失焦提交后抢回焦点，单击 SQL 编辑器无法直接粘贴 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9797](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9797))\n- 修复表设计器操作列图标悬停提示缺少动作名称 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9916](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9916))\n- 修复检索时未展开数据库的对象分组不可见，及同表名多库只显示一个 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9905](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9905))\n- 修复库表视图工具栏过窄时搜索框与筛选控件重叠 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9798](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9798))\n- 修复查询结果导出文件名未沿用结果标签页名称 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9919](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9919))\n- 修复数据比较结果被页脚遮挡无法滚动到底 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9857](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9857))\n- 修复结构对比部署脚本未按外键依赖排序导致同步中途失败 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9794](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9794))\n- 修复快捷键改键后因格式未归一化导致设置无法保存 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9897](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9897))\n- 修复客户端包已下载时更新中心「更新全部」无响应 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9821](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9821))\n- 修复滚动型对话框在壁纸背景下透出底层内容 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#9888](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9888))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.19) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.19` 拉取。\n","reactions":{"total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":14}
